<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Kirov factory H1 pre-tax rises.</title>
<headline>Russia's Kirov factory H1 pre-tax rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>				  1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  90.10 bln rbls    64.80 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Sales revenues	 663.90 bln rbls   292.30 bln rbls</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name AO Kirovsky Zavod. Company is one of Russia's biggest tractor producers and also makes road repairing equipment.</p>
<p>Figures to Russian accounting system.</p>
<p>Its main shareholders are Promstroibank St Petersburg with 13.80 percent of shares, Baltiisky Emissionny Soyuz with 8.10 percent, General Investment Fund with 5.20 percent, AOZT Agregat with 4.30 percent, Swiss private bank Pictet &amp; Cie with 1.38 percent.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
